{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/s1_sub_009.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/s1_sub_009.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_01",
      "hash64": "1F448505EF2E55A5",
      "text": "哦哦～呵、呵、呵！\\n哦哦～呵、呵、呵！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_02",
      "hash64": "1F448205EF2E508C",
      "text": "这就是帕底亚的正中心！\\n多么巨大的坑洞啊！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_man_01",
      "hash64": "BF03D5FA090C2B27",
      "text": "是呀，馥好！\\n这就是帕底亚巨坑哦！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_03",
      "hash64": "1F448305EF2E523F",
      "text": "毅万！我的探究精神\\n就是接连不断的冒险！\\r\\n让我们立刻进去赛一赛富豪的实力吧！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_man_02",
      "hash64": "BF03D6FA090C2CDA",
      "text": "馥好，这可不行呀！\\n巨坑里面是禁止入内的！\\r\\n虽然我申请了，但没有通过……[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_04",
      "hash64": "1F448005EF2E4D26",
      "text": "你说什么！？\\n就算是名流也不行吗？[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_man_03",
      "hash64": "BF03D7FA090C2E8D",
      "text": "就算是名流也不行呀！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_05",
      "hash64": "1F448105EF2E4ED9",
      "text": "旅行的压台一站岂能留下遗憾！？\\c\\n没想到这世上竟然有\\n连名流也行不通的事……！！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_06",
      "hash64": "1F447E05EF2E49C0",
      "text": "哎呀……？\\n是和我们结下孽缘的那位庶民！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_man_04",
      "hash64": "BF03D0FA090C22A8",
      "text": "还真是。毫无疑问，\\n那就是和我们结下孽缘的庶民！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_07",
      "hash64": "1F447F05EF2E4B73",
      "text": "话说回来，这位庶民，\\n你进过这个巨坑吗？[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_select_01",
      "hash64": "6AE5BF5DD07C5835",
      "text": "进过！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_select_02",
      "hash64": "6AE5BC5DD07C531C",
      "text": "没进过",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_08",
      "hash64": "1F448C05EF2E618A",
      "text": "……你刚刚说什么！？\\n把我这个名流晾在一边！？\\r\\n庶民反而可以进入巨坑！？庶民赛馥好！？[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_09",
      "hash64": "1F448D05EF2E633D",
      "text": "名流也不行，庶民也不行，\\n那到底谁能进入这个巨坑呀！？\\r\\n我、我的脑子有点混乱……呜呜！！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_10",
      "hash64": "1F480A05EF316D7B",
      "text": "……既然如此，\\n我们只好来一场决斗了呢。[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_man_05",
      "hash64": "BF03D1FA090C245B",
      "text": "出……出现了！\\n馥好的爱好！就像半路杀出只暴飞龙——\\r\\n出其不意发起决斗的那一套～！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_24",
      "hash64": "1F3DFC05EF29012C",
      "text": "在这里不太方便，\\n我就下去了哦！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_11",
      "hash64": "1F480905EF316BC8",
      "text": "呵呵呵……要是做好心理准备了，\\n就由庶民你来邀请我开始吧。[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_man_npc",
      "hash64": "33DE49DC919ADCBB",
      "text": "虽然就像半路杀出只暴飞龙，\\n但你就和馥好决斗吧！\\r\\n虽然就像半路杀出只暴飞龙！！[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_12",
      "hash64": "1F480C05EF3170E1",
      "text": "来和我最终决斗！\\n你愿意接受吧？[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_13",
      "hash64": "1F480B05EF316F2E",
      "text": "……虽说偶尔被庶民\\n吊吊胃口也不错……\\c\\n但名流的时间是宝贵的！\\n现在立刻就来开打咯～～～！！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_14",
      "hash64": "1F480E05EF317447",
      "text": "帕底亚不动产的社长馥好！\\n要来碾压庶民咯～～～！！[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_man_06",
      "hash64": "BF03D2FA090C260E",
      "text": "[EMPTY 42]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_15",
      "hash64": "1F480D05EF317294",
      "text": "冷静下来之后，\\n我终于明白了呢。[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_16",
      "hash64": "1F481005EF3177AD",
      "text": "名流和庶民同样都是人……\\n二者之间根本就没有壁垒呢。[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_17",
      "hash64": "1F480F05EF3175FA",
      "text": "这么简单的事情，为什么我\\n至今为止都没有意识到呢……[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_18",
      "hash64": "1F480205EF315FE3",
      "text": "我好惭愧，甚至想\\n找个坑钻进去……\\r\\n不过巨坑不能进就是了。[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_man_07",
      "hash64": "BF03D3FA090C27C1",
      "text": "馥好……[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_19",
      "hash64": "1F480105EF315E30",
      "text": "你一定是为了\\n教会我这个道理，\\r\\n才一直追着我们的吧。[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_20",
      "hash64": "1F3DF805EF28FA60",
      "text": "你不说我也都明白哦。[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_woman_21",
      "hash64": "1F3DF905EF28FC13",
      "text": "我对你的感激无以言表……\\n能请你至少收下这份礼物吗？[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "s1_sub_009_system_02",
      "hash64": "00D67C0FE2218C4F",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n获得了[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]名流手机壳[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
